| Module | Exports |
|--------|---------|
| `src/sm2.ts` | `SM2State`, `ReviewRecord`, `Grade`, `createInitialSM2State`, `calculateSM2`, `mapGradeToQuality`, `isDue`, `getOverdueDays`, `todayDateString` |
